sequenceDiagram
    participant Router as llm-d Router/Scheduler
    participant VLLMServer as vLLM Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant ConfigPlugin as ServerConfigPlugin
    participant DevicesPlugin as ServerDevicesPlugin
    participant KVCachePlugin as ServerKVCachePlugin
    participant AppState as FastAPI app.state<br/>Cached Responses
    participant EngineClient as EngineClient
    participant Workers as Worker Processes<br/>DeviceInfoWorkerExtension

    Note over VLLMServer,Workers: Startup Phase (one-time initialization)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of ConfigPlugin: Config Plugin Init
        VLLMServer->>ConfigPlugin: init_state(vllm_config, engine_client)
        ConfigPlugin->>ConfigPlugin: Build ServerConfigResponse<br/>from VllmConfig internals
        ConfigPlugin->>ConfigPlugin: Redact kv_connector_extra_config<br/>(unless LLM_D_INTROSPECTION_EXPOSE_KV_EXTRA_CONFIG=1)
        ConfigPlugin->>AppState: Cache response on app.state
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note right of DevicesPlugin: Devices Plugin Init
        VLLMServer->>DevicesPlugin: init_state(vllm_config, engine_client)
        DevicesPlugin->>EngineClient: collective_rpc("device_info")
        EngineClient->>Workers: Dispatch to all ranks
        Workers->>Workers: Query current_platform<br/>device name, memory,<br/>compute capability
        Workers-->>EngineClient: Per-rank DeviceInfo
        EngineClient-->>DevicesPlugin: List of DeviceInfo
        DevicesPlugin->>AppState: Cache response on app.state
        Note right of DevicesPlugin: 503 if worker extension<br/>not installed
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of KVCachePlugin: KV Cache Plugin Init
        VLLMServer->>KVCachePlugin: init_state(vllm_config, engine_client)
        KVCachePlugin->>EngineClient: get_kv_cache_spec()
        EngineClient-->>KVCachePlugin: KV cache capacity
        KVCachePlugin->>KVCachePlugin: hasattr check:<br/>get_kv_cache_group_metadata?
        alt vLLM supports group metadata
            KVCachePlugin->>EngineClient: get_kv_cache_group_metadata()
            EngineClient-->>KVCachePlugin: Attention group specs
        else older vLLM build
            Note right of KVCachePlugin: groups field empty
        end
        KVCachePlugin->>AppState: Cache response on app.state
    end

    Note over Router,AppState: Runtime Phase (per-request)

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/config
    VLLMServer->>ConfigPlugin: Route handler
    ConfigPlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>ConfigPlugin: ServerConfigResponse
    ConfigPlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: Server config data

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/devices
    VLLMServer->>DevicesPlugin: Route handler
    DevicesPlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>DevicesPlugin: ServerDevicesResponse
    DevicesPlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: Per-rank GPU properties

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/kv-cache
    VLLMServer->>KVCachePlugin: Route handler
    KVCachePlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>KVCachePlugin: KVCacheResponse
    KVCachePlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: KV cache capacity + groups
